<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="CH2b1559-zh-0c8a1e15" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>成于乐 _ __乐记____声无哀乐论__选读 </title><editor role="translator">Huang Ronghua 黃榮華 and Yin Shengjuan 殷勝娟</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>成于乐 _ __乐记____声无哀乐论__选读 </title>上海：復旦大學出版社，2013</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#CH2b1559"><title xml:lang="och"/></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="zh">modern Chinese</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2026-05-13T23:58:56.731+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="CH2b1559-start"><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:31:01.164+09:00">有位秦客向东野主人发问：【从秦客的发问可知，东野主人不认同先贤们包括孔子、季札在内关于音乐有哀乐的理解，认为音乐本身并没有什么哀乐可言。这是《声无哀乐论》的总起。由这总起可知，“声无哀乐论”之“声”与“治世之音”之“音”属于同一范畴，即音乐。有人认为“声无哀乐论”所论之“声”属于普通的自然声是不对的。】</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.27" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:37:00.116+09:00">对音乐名与实的理解失实以至混乱。【①滥于名实：滥：失，乱。名，人们赋予音乐的名称，如哀乐，如善恶。实，音乐的本质。嵇康认为音乐的本质在善恶，不在哀乐。哀乐属于感情，不属于音乐。】</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.42" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:40:46.016+09:00">哪里会凭人们的爱和憎就容易被操弄，【④操：操弄。】</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.59" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:46:48.03+09:00">然而，‘说快乐呀快乐，⑥乐云乐云，钟鼓云乎哉：出自《论语·阳货》，前句为“礼云，礼云，玉帛云乎哉”。两句大意为：礼不只是玉帛之类的礼器，乐不只是钟鼓之类的乐器。此处引用，是说快乐不是钟鼓（音乐）表现的。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.98" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:58:49.837+09:00">哪里还明白千差万别的感情都是自己从内心流露出来，而不是音乐本身固有的呢？⑦吹万不同，而使自己：语出《庄子·齐物论》，大意为，风吹大地，千万洞窍发出声音，是洞窍自身发出各种声音。此处引用是想说明，声音来自自然，并借以说明听乐后出现的感情是听乐人自身的内心所发出的，并非音乐使其产生。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.105" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:08:05.547+09:00">⑧讽：讽喻，用含蓄委婉的语言劝告、劝谏。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.137" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:09:00.813+09:00">⑨一致：最完美的境界。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.142" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:09:33.419+09:00">⑩思过半：领悟到了其中的大部分。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:31:13.317+09:00">“听到前人有这样的论说：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:31:31.76+09:00">‘天下大治时音乐安适、欢乐；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:31:56.398+09:00">国家灭亡或濒临灭亡时，音乐哀戚、忧伤。’</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:32:12.306+09:00">天下安定还是混乱在于政治清明与否，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:32:24.349+09:00">而音乐就是政治清明与否的表现，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:32:42.85+09:00">所以人们哀戚、忧伤的情感</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:32:55.113+09:00">通过金石制作的乐器表现出来，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:33:11.963+09:00">安适、欢乐的心情</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:33:18.243+09:00">通过管弦乐器表现出来。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:33:36.982+09:00">又听说仲尼欣赏《韶》乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:33:41.774+09:00">就能知晓虞舜的高尚德行；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:33:55.951+09:00">季札欣赏音乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:34:00.282+09:00">就知晓了各个国家的社会风气。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:34:05.854+09:00">这些已经成为历史故事，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:34:18.929+09:00">先贤们都确信无疑。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:34:38.912+09:00">现在唯有您认为音乐不能表现哀乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:34:46.99+09:00">它的道理在哪里呢？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:35:03.309+09:00">如果您有精彩的阐述，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:35:07.633+09:00">请让我也来听一听。”</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:36:12.286+09:00">主人回答说：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.24" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:36:18.311+09:00">“这其中的道理被掩埋很久了，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.25" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:36:27.188+09:00">没有谁愿意来阐发它，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.26" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:36:41.351+09:00">所以使得世世代代的人们</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.28" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:37:07.308+09:00">今天承蒙您的启发，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.29" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:37:15.9+09:00">我就谈谈其中的一点吧。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.30" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:37:30.158+09:00">“天地阴阳二气协和，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.31" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:37:44.17+09:00">万物依赖它们生长，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.32" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:38:12.43+09:00">寒暑交替运行，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.33" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:38:16.917+09:00">五行因此而生成，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.34" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:38:21.263+09:00">显示为五色，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.35" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:38:25.541+09:00">表现为五音。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.36" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:38:29.802+09:00">音乐的产生，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.37" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:39:02.708+09:00">就好像气味存在天地之间一样自然，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.38" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:39:12.631+09:00">它好听或不好听，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.39" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:39:40.826+09:00">即使遭遇混乱的环境，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.40" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:40:28.306+09:00">本质也</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.41" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:40:32.556+09:00">不会发生变化，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.43" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:40:53.196+09:00">因为人们的哀和乐而改变它的律度呢？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.44" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:41:09.983+09:00">至于五音会聚，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.45" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:41:15.4+09:00">组成和谐的音乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.46" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:41:21.471+09:00">这是人们内心的最高意愿，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.47" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:41:37.491+09:00">情感欲望聚合的地方。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.48" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:41:44.068+09:00">古人知晓情感不能放纵，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.49" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:42:04.146+09:00">欲望不能获得最大满足，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.50" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:42:12.874+09:00">所以依据情感欲望的需要，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.51" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:42:18.44+09:00">时常进行节度，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.52" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:42:26.631+09:00">使得哀伤而不伤害身心，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.53" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:42:33.868+09:00">快乐而不放纵无度；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.54" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:43:39.792+09:00">依据不同事物的属性</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.56" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:43:39.791+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-zh-0c8a1e15">哭泣叫做哀，歌唱叫做乐，这就是名与实统一的大致情况。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.55" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:43:39.793+09:00">给予不同的名号，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.57" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:43:53.067+09:00">歌唱叫做乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.58" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:44:00.476+09:00">这就是名与实统一的大致情况。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.60" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:49:28.122+09:00">是钟鼓在说快乐吗’？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.61" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:49:41.572+09:00">说哀伤呀哀伤，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.62" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:49:47.505+09:00">是哭泣在说哀伤吗？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.63" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:49:57.79+09:00">顺着这种逻辑思考，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.64" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:50:21.013+09:00">那就可以说，玉帛就不是祭礼仪式本质的东西，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.65" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:51:58.564+09:00">歌唱哭泣也不是快乐哀伤的本质。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.66" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:52:09.049+09:00">凭什么明白这个道理？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.67" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:52:15.887+09:00">不同的地方有不同的风俗，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.68" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:52:28.893+09:00">因此歌唱或哭泣的原因就不相同。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.69" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:52:43.952+09:00">假如同一种音乐在不同的地方使用，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.70" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:52:51.253+09:00">就会有这样的现象：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.71" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:53:16.137+09:00">有人听到了在别处让人流泪的音乐他竟然高兴，有人听到了在别处让人高兴得情不自禁地唱歌的音乐他却悲伤起来。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.72" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:53:22.106+09:00">不过他们都有悲哀或快乐的情感这点却是一致的。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.73" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:53:31.563+09:00">现在，凭借着一样的情感</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.74" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:53:37.162+09:00">而发出千差万别的声音，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.75" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:53:55.174+09:00">这不是表明声音是变化莫测、无有常态的吗？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.76" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:54:32.52+09:00">“但是，声音和谐地组织成乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.77" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:54:42.158+09:00">是最感动人心的。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.78" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:54:54.72+09:00">劳作的人</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.79" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:55:00.995+09:00">用歌声歌咏自己的劳作，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.80" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:55:06.938+09:00">快乐的人用舞蹈表达自己的快乐。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.81" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:55:16.002+09:00">如果内心悲痛，就会发出哀痛的言语。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.82" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:55:24.771+09:00">言语组织成诗歌，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.83" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:55:39.862+09:00">声音组成曲调。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.84" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:55:47.804+09:00">大家纷纷歌咏，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.85" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:55:56.372+09:00">聚集在一起聆听，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.86" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:56:00.662+09:00">内心被和谐的音乐打动，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.87" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:56:34.462+09:00">情感被悲苦的言语触动，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.88" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:56:53.164+09:00">感叹还没有停歇，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.89" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:56:59.86+09:00">眼泪就纵横了。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.90" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:57:04.591+09:00">悲哀的情感隐藏在内心，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.91" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:57:22.241+09:00">遇到和谐的音乐就被触发而流露，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.92" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:57:28.11+09:00">和谐的音乐没有特殊的外形，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.93" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:57:36.2+09:00">但是哀伤的情感却有它的主体。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.94" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:57:43.713+09:00">有主体的哀伤情感，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.95" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:58:23.436+09:00">依着没有特殊外形的和谐音乐而流露出来，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.96" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:58:54.206+09:00">他能感觉到的</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.97" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:59:43.24+09:00">只有哀伤而已，</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>